  "details": "a little complicated, but here me out: We use to think spawnObject could never work with setMaterial, and I found out why.\nScene_Descriptor's Dynamic Materials list removes materials you manually enter into it that don't exist on objects. This means if I have a prefab that is not in the hierarchy and I upload my world, it will not include those materials in the launched world and never set the materials correctly.\nSimple Fix: Don't remove materials from prefabs in the project files, or at the very least allow us to choose an option to \"do not update list\" when launching.",
